y have all mastered ultra  instinct so the idea here is that Goku's  knew silver or white hair is a sign that  he has risen to the level of an angel  and that he is becoming unintel the  second major factor is the ending of  Dragon Ball Z if you think back to the  peaceful world saga in the last three  episodes of Dragon Ball Z in particular  you will remember that after a time skip  that takes us beyond the events of  Dragon Ball super chronologically we see  Goku wearing a completely different gear  or training uniform he is wearing a  light blue key with a white belt blueish  steel pants and orange wristbands many  people see this as significant because  Goku ze changes throughout the Dragon  Ball franchise to reflect the different  masters that he is training under so  just as an example when he trains under  Master Roshi Goku receives a key with  the kanji or symbol for turtle because  of course Master Roshi is the turtle  hermit when training under King Kai King  Kai's kanji is added to the back of Goku  ski and of course when training with  wheeze both Goku and Vegeta have Lisa's  own symbol added to the front of their  training uniform so the argument is that  Goku's new blue key along with the  orange wristbands is a sign that either  he has become the next grand priest and  so he has adopted the color scheme that  the grand priest wears and of course we  know that the grand priest wears blue  with an orange symbol on the front that  looks like an upside-down pyramid or  triangle and the other interpretation is  that maybe this new color scheme changes  because Goku has started training under  the grand priest and so in order to  honor his new master Goku decided to  wear a new uniform  okay so let's examine this idea that  Goku will become the next grand priest  first this idea stems from the fact that  Goku is allegedly good friends with Zeno  and for this reason Zeno will pick Goku  to become his new right-hand man and the  new grand priest  however I personally do not see any  reason why the grand priest would want  to step down from his role the grand  priest is not mortal so it's not like he  needs to worry about getting too old and  going into retirement and from  everything we've seen he seems to be  getting along quite well with Zeno I  believe that this theory about Goku  replacing the grand priest comes from  the idea that the grand priest is evil  and that Goku will have to defeat him  and then replace him as xennos attendant  but as you guys know I personally don't  think that the grand priest is evil or a  villain so I believe that this theory is  out of the question  I mean maybe the grand priest  tired of serving under Zeno because the  Omni king is so naive and childish so  maybe he would want to try to get Goku  to replace him since Goku is often very  immature and childish himself so I guess  maybe he would make a better companion  for Zeno but we have to remember that  Goku is not immortal and the Omni King  is so even if Goku took over as the next  grand priest he could only serve Zeno  for a very short period of time from  xennos perspective regarding this theory  that goku might somehow become the next  grand priest I just don't see it  happening however the idea that the  grand priest might decide to train Goku  is much more plausible Goku is obviously  very interested in training under the  strongest fighter he can find and we  know that the grand priest is stronger  than wheeze the grand priest does show  an interest in Goku earlier on in the  series when he first meets him and  because of this we see invites the grand  priest to come and visit universe 7 so  this could be foreshadowing that the  grand priest will take Goku on and  become his new master and then after the  grand priest trains Goku Goku will go on  to train uber which is what he ends up  doing at the end of Dragon Ball Z and  just in case you don't remember boob is  a ten year old boy who is the  reincarnation of majin buu aka Kid Buu  but in the body of a good person  personally I could definitely see this  one happening especially now that the  Tournament of Power is ending I can  totally see the grand priests being  impressed with Goku's performance at the  tournament and I can also see Goku  begging the grand priest to train him so  maybe as a reward for his strong showing  at the tournament the grand priest will  give in and become Goku's new master  this theory is definitely possible in my  opinion and finally the theory that Goku  will himself become an angel now I get  why some people feel this way Goku's  hair is becoming similar to the hair of  the angels he is mastering ultra  instinct like the angels and of course  we know that the angels are more  powerful than the gods of destruction so  as Goku surpasses the level of a god of  destruction his logical next step is to  strive to reach the power of angels some  also believe that maybe the reason Goku  decides to train foob at the end of Jang  of allsey is because Goku has become the  new angel for universe  and he is training food just like we  strained him and Vegeta with the goal  being to make food into one of the  protectors of universe 7 however it  seems pretty clear that the angels are  all members of a specific race and that  they have similar physical features  which doesn't just include white hair  but also blue skin and so on some people  have suggested that maybe the reason  that all the angels have white hair is  because they are in a permanent state of  mastered ultra instinct but I don't  think that that makes sense  we know that's a mas who had naturally  white hair even though he wasn't an  angel so again the fact that your hair  becomes white does not automatically  make you an angel I can see the argument  that Goku after mastering ultra instinct  has surpassed the power of a god of  destruction and is approaching the power  of an angel but being as strong as an  angel does not actually make him one and  so in terms of the angel theory it's  definitely a no from me and that is my  opinion on these three currently popular  theories I think that the grand priests  deciding to train Goku after the  tournament is plausible and I could see  it happening but I do not think that  Goku will become either an angel or the  next Grand Prix's feel free to let me  know what you guys think about these  theories and feel free to share any  theories of your own down in the  comments if you enjoy the Dragon Ball  super content on this channel and you  want to see more be sure to leave a like  to let me know if you are new don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell we are now posting  daily anime content on Twitter and  Instagram so feel free to follow us at  anime uproar and if you want to discuss  anime theories recommendations and more  on a daily basis feel free to join our  discord server link in the description  as always thank you all so much for  watching and until next time see us  space cowboys  you  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

